\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{t}^{2}+{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+2{t}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, if $f(x,y)=\\frac{y+z}{x}$, then we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =\\frac{\\frac{{t}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{t}^{2}}{2}}{t}=t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}\\frac{y+z}{x}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{2}}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{2}}t\\sqrt{1+2{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this using the substitution $u=1+2{t}^{2}$, $\\text{d}u=4t\\,\\text{d}t$ as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{2}}t\\sqrt{1+2{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{3}^{5}\\sqrt{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{3}^{5}{u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2}\\,{|}_{3}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}({5}^{3/2}-{3}^{3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{5}-3\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330487 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330488 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330489 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330490 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330491 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1041 "selection" 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330488 13194139535087 true] [17592186330486 1110 #uuid "162e39cd-8ff0-5480-8347-cac99e7301ab" 13194139535087 true] [17592186330487 1034 "\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535087 true] [17592186330487 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535087 true] [17592186330487 1111 #uuid "ec8bde36-aa42-53ec-8a9d-c7fd1d226bf3" 13194139535087 true] [17592186330488 1034 "\\frac{5\\sqrt{5}-3\\sqrt{